{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6b760d9a8eeea21fa60c52fc927aec66208bbb284b1044189051e672f0ab8b5a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d59dab2d5d0afdf68e54287ded051298946094f3511c81104ad4f0d3e4999d62",
      "text": "某天的碰头会前。克里斯找想乐和\n制作人商量，雨彦生日时要不要办点什么。\n面对询问具体想做什么的想乐，克里斯提议\n举办一场小小的派对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c37d9624085e5b6819a34b0437f78448d320f37866b9b27d1fa1eb368f1e83e",
      "text": "辛苦啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa4d40e2eb6acd36a22f8bd9a2d4847cf95720f8bc06aa5a2787eb41adf8e84",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:127ea4087345b336dad3e481b4feacf632d37ff2c178cca4fd1936bfe760067b",
      "text": "辛苦了！等大家都到齐了，我们再开始碰头会。\n到时间之前请随意休息吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2642a8b9e57a5b1899c5b741fc30a4ccb2bbc7070f0d2d2f3b54c3d92e20c801",
      "text": "哈……说起来马上就是雨彦的生日了呢！\n一年一度的重要日子。不做点什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5515e8201193dac4d19a87da264db1449dbd76bec02ac4f310d304fc08c0f1",
      "text": "克里斯先生，\n想做什么样的事呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e030768d42e620070e4e4f95b3169d864ef803936098e6410178caa45a3ca3d0",
      "text": "我想办个小小的派对！\n因为大家之前也为我庆祝过了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d838701ba173cca9b8583af9fdc072ceb1d0dc2ca60e6a70c5e53f834ebed848",
      "text": "像克里斯先生生日会那样的感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fccfa94e03d9a002e8b7f83b2f100e084b7e349f8aa424941ded20db91927be5",
      "text": "（那个规模的话，\n对我们现在的关系来说刚刚好呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf419f752d921f8e2d4ebfeb9bb61e3f4c4263c810a7ebc5fbb908d03f125840",
      "text": "嗯～，我觉得挺好～。就按要办的方向定吧～。\n剩下的之后再说。雨彦先生也差不多该来了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de9962c14714ca72db109e957fb380f1cc5cb42c0729a5299485f609412b9e4",
      "text": "辛苦啦，大家在聊什么呢。\n好像听到了我的名字啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08e45c075a7308cc29aa67f43875500c714881fa2a04213eb0d3fd6a6649de89",
      "text": "只是在聊雨彦先生怎么还没来呢～而已哦～。\n对吧～，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8874391563d3abfa3d88bea1f279100d1d0d977f24e65ecd0fffe2efd81d8f5",
      "text": "是的！既然大家都到齐了，\n虽然稍微早了点，我们就开始碰头会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903c1b425bacda171af5ab5569c41beb3b93c8235d860d6173f537404a33bb66",
      "text": "另一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb1253fc4305bcbbd0b5f080863dc514602884831dc2337ec003e830866142c",
      "text": "那么，大家来各自说说想到的方案吧。\n首先从提议者的我开始可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50868fe8824fe5c8b0f5b341d61270c80a5f4f0b04768ba04bc8d6a0c25e3188",
      "text": "嗯，拜托啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac6d8643fef75ee57bd38abe72833a767b9d18f9f6bddff8d3a601b8c596662",
      "text": "水族馆怎么样？不仅能和许多海洋生物接触，\n还能了解它们的生态！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:397910d729e1c8d0eb3d89530a42f0d94656cb39fcb5012cea57577d32853649",
      "text": "那个留到克里斯先生生日的时候办比较好哦～。\n作为明年的候选吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fdf78ab7976e82f29040f6f2c83cff8409c693e079fb8fa74f4a1158a38ec1a",
      "text": "我明白了。既然如此，海鲜市场怎么样。\n我听说他挺喜欢吃海鲜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9212a823eb969d0a44648abca4ae52f2bcb8ed0c6670582246bdef5966d8314a",
      "text": "那样的话，选一个雨彦先生方便去的地方\n怎么样呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65c5ba40be6a086e41037ddf1bd6dbd191d8d1ad197e686a9f551de44beb8a65",
      "text": "是呢。\n去海鲜市场就留到下次机会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95e475447ac1f0a12437b78ffa7c42d5fdbb3f3da67623f0c95f2d852fe03b1e",
      "text": "难得过一次生日，我们再多想点\n点子出来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b571384ea64d5e5fbd02c1b8db1a8f7a9257a865a2b1bbb216c1b21f0a5aa805",
      "text": "综合大家的意见，最后还是聚餐呢。\n定在生日当天可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e17dc448f2fce22602003e4cdf36b473b8440dcbbbeeeedc972908d49b7de0b4",
      "text": "那天的话，大家正好都休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c7236d7b67e216af4e2540e6742462acb73a9d519cb48e01080ff1bccfb298",
      "text": "雨彦先生的生日是万圣节当天对吧～。\n避开可能会很拥挤的晚餐，改成午餐怎么样～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd429e38ec99fb93caccd7297f7fdaafba48ca368a76df3685b4b76ebb0eac4f",
      "text": "赞成！我知道一家能吃到美味海鲜的店，\n定在那里怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36a0991213fee1b37a2822cfb4db2d671e0dd067712a4493a92cce03ebe8152",
      "text": "西班牙风味的马赛鱼汤萨苏埃拉，\n堪称一绝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf7e9761b021511aa450a78639aff3d389fde5272d4c569eb2cc41dcab9579a",
      "text": "这个时节的话，\n应该是以当季的鱿鱼和大虾为主。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89e8996357b7902234dba9f63552f3ca6f01b4b2a260a63ac46292ec67388da8",
      "text": "好呀！就定在那里吧。\n克里斯先生推荐的店铺肯定不会错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb3efdd0b6f986569437a7bc4349f96a385d90f6a22d7d526d024846dbde1496",
      "text": "下次碰头会结束之后，\n跟雨彦先生提提看吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000062:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6431d35ecc91488152481fb23fe0f1886db5adeb6d65c1ebe08f33668df273c",
      "text": "另一次碰头会结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66952a9f12282a17bdd7a406897275ed937ffebbfb8f29264aae51edd386a78c",
      "text": "雨彦，稍微打扰一下可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a83fa76b503bf4b4df21827052cca053030f4f52bd9998bf0b728cb3fa3e1fe",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了，古论。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c15aa5ba18a61e307ce01d841897a43c32f23e317ab87966ceb347e10ceac23e",
      "text": "雨彦生日那天，\n在场的大家一起去吃午饭怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cb7e8ff2e259ecc8c503c1a3d6d92e266bbfc7faae589a7635a4f618b21043",
      "text": "虽说只是小小的聚餐，\n但想为你庆祝一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d37c757358de596e679226d9966ef8e1c3dbf5a4037f312933899b6cb7ed5db4",
      "text": "啊啊，这样啊。今年也能有人替我庆祝生日，\n真是感激不尽。我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf73ae9f335c364d3b1367e6a1744fa521cc452a74f433435f2ee33b2eb3a157",
      "text": "雨彦，祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:888454f3c236f17d2ce8b6333c5e3f5d8899a37f00f2cfa2421442e5225a5986",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐，雨彦先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27ff7382b8cbd89c21878d7715dfb9a3e871dd7da5f557f0a6ac10c3f8dd5142",
      "text": "生日快乐～。这是大家一起挑的哦～。\n里面的东西就留到打开之后再期待吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25253b7b67a1a380e76d2286360e95e595505abd3791e1e9602e33dab3db875",
      "text": "连生日礼物都为我准备了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b00d2ddfb10f29e2ce885c5fe0c1ce9ca1b55935260eee2e974a989124e72a9",
      "text": "谢谢你们啊。真没想到你们居然背着我准备了这些，\n完全没察觉到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f501fd5b14c7fef890cd727998f7c055a319ce67be56d3c614b5441cc3b6adf",
      "text": "就当成是这样吧～。制作人和\n克里斯先生可是非常努力地在准备呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933e2186d92a56f047d05fa4d281e07ba99c7fb7fbc267de10ab79e9979901ad",
      "text": "想乐也提了很多宝贵的意见哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc2d4aed5de50925efa9219cc64568ec75136f2a1a79a2730e97b62f02b0417",
      "text": "选了我们大家意见达成一致的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f371f6d7057ee579b104e579ba3ace1bd82b69df0c6cc73af0aec4aad63b954",
      "text": "嚯。那可真让人期待看看是什么呢。\n留作之后的期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74621d8fc4290323dc092c094f989d2605c06741fb26814fb7d9cbe779e175e7",
      "text": "古论挑的那家店的料理，味道都很不错啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7245fad53b02210e865ffb11e8b836559d47afb7e8290e2e4d82179e1ffeda9",
      "text": "能让今天的主角满意，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c64c16d07a7cec27d1ef000e661b134fb5cabd3e1f9b14045413450834b102",
      "text": "我还知道其他海鲜很好吃的店。\n下一次生日，去海鲜市场怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b4de23d8137b34db0a960f33660fac02835100bfda029159b2ced9a0d9f5fa",
      "text": "明年的事就明年再定吧～。\n想带去吃的店说不定到时候就变了嘛～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f8b13a3a86017c6f90ccd5afb3a4884477b7b5b2cf412b4903d94562df7ad0",
      "text": "哈哈，正如北村所说啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43018ea82d1052a9b893dbf2f3210b915a1577d6a6d2fb7947e88680b0fb5c90",
      "text": "克里斯先生，到时候我们3人再一起定吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10926ea25a2d9a9196314835abff7eb5605f0143b16b8037464f705cce80dd9",
      "text": "好的，说得也是。\n下次我再带您去雨彦会喜欢的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d91ce91a6d38f6cf445ab0e225b3c7745dcbabdb20962d3446c3a29f8a343a3b",
      "text": "那就拜托啦。……好啦，差不多该解散了吧。\n街上变装的人也陆陆续续多起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d23a2b7d2cdec68adf30b4b4325ff91660be18fecc8fe2867e5aa1fd3f70e1e9",
      "text": "今天再次谢谢你们啦。\n等你们过生日的时候，我也好好回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd08eb76b8b9502b4671340b27193605d9f0bc6a250255dc66c80a7d27a7429",
      "text": "好的，我很期待明年的生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90eb3e74c3636dad3487234babade90c982c4a8e7460c4b9832debe47e192435",
      "text": "请手下留情哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
